# Wave T56 (Palmside kit): sunlounger — a resort lounger with a coral frame (the town door colour), a cream cushion with a coral centre stripe and a folded towel at its head. Stands as a pair on VILLA HOSTESS PRIA's lawn — the town sign's 'softest beds' and the painting's rest-terrace loungers realized at the hostess's own ground; her dialogue is the beat ('Champions rest here between legends. The villas keep their towels folded'). Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (tg-sunnyshore #008100/#003f00). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T56-PALMSIDE-PLAN.md §3.3/§5.)
